{
  "version": "2026-04-24",
  "name": "feishu_interactive_01_accept",
  "description": "正式版 01 受理 interactive card 模板。用于任务已被正式受理并明确下一责任人。",
  "message_type": "accept",
  "message_code": "01",
  "label": "受理",
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "blue",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title_prefix}｜01 受理"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "受理确认 · {task_name}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**✦ 受理概览**\n事项名称｜{task_name}\n当前责任人｜{owner_mention}\n下一责任人｜{next_owner_mentions}\n当前状态｜{status}\n受理目标｜{goal}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◈ 受理判断**\n1. {judgement_1}\n2. {judgement_2}\n3. {judgement_3}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◔ 当前状态**\n当前状态｜{status}\n下一节点｜{next_milestone}\n需确认事项｜{decision_note}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**☰ 后续动作**\n{actions_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**receipt｜**以回读与 mention 验证为准。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "default_values": {
    "next_owner_mentions": "-",
    "decision_note": "无"
  },
  "business_sections": {
    "actions": {
      "render_key": "actions_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "action_item_",
      "max_items": 3,
      "required": true
    }
  },
  "required_placeholders": [
    "title_prefix",
    "task_name",
    "owner_mention",
    "goal",
    "judgement_1",
    "judgement_2",
    "judgement_3",
    "status",
    "next_milestone",
    "actions_md"
  ]
}
